    <description>North wall, west of the range. Counter 0.900 high x 0.635 deep, 0.600 carcass, and a 0.089 high x 0.076 deep toe kick (3.5" x 3", US standard) - deliberately lower than the 0.097 m robot, so it cannot drive in. Origin is the back (wall) face, centred on length, on the floor; the unit grows towards -y. Finishes match across the whole kitchen family: wood.png doors (from Cabinet), marble.png counters (from TableMarble), brushed stainless handles.</description>
</model>
